@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Initializing
Initializing --> Running : initialize ok
Initializing --> Stopping : stop
Initializing --> Draining : drain
Initializing --> Failed : initialize failed

Running --> Paused : pause
Paused --> Running : resume
Running --> Draining : drain / clients closed
Paused --> Draining : drain / clients closed
Running --> Stopping : stop
Paused --> Stopping : stop
Draining --> Stopping : stop
Running --> Failed : root handler panic
Paused --> Failed : in-flight handler panic
Draining --> Failed : in-flight handler panic
Stopping --> Failed : in-flight handler panic

Draining --> Stopped : accepted work settled\nshutdown ok
Stopping --> Stopped : cooperative cancellation settled\nshutdown ok
Draining --> Failed : shutdown failed
Stopping --> Failed : shutdown failed

note right of Draining
  Reject new business
  Do not cancel accepted Futures
end note

note right of Stopping
  Reject new business
  Cancel service tree and cancellable Tasks
  Wait for stable settlement
end note

note bottom of Stopped
  ServiceTask::abort or dropping its ownership
  force-drops the root Future as the final escape hatch
end note
@enduml
